&\xlongequal{\text{洛必达法则}} \lim_{x \to 0} \frac{\dfrac{-\sin x}{\cos x}}{2x} \\
&= \lim_{x \to 0} \frac{-\tan x}{2x} = -\frac{1}{2}
\end{aligned}
$
